              "config": {
                "description": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24pt;\"><strong>SailPoint User&#39;s Guide</strong></span></p>\n<p>You selected to review common tasks which you might need to perform within SailPoint.</p>\n<p>If you need more information, please review the <a href=\"https://documentation.sailpoint.com/saas/user-help/index.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\">SailPoint documentation</a>.</p>\n<p>You can also reach out for help via Slack in <strong><span style=\"color: #236fa1;\">#help-identity-security</span></strong>.</p>\n<p> </p>",
                "label": "Introduction",
                "showLabel": false
              },
              "elementType": "DESCRIPTION",
