          "formElements": [
            {
              "config": {
                "description": "<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">The following links to helpful reference materials are provided for you to use:</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><a href=\"https://sailpoint.highspot.com/items/63f3a8e75ff97f2c86b976a2?lfrm=shp.27\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\">Submit an Access Request</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><a href=\"https://documentation.sailpoint.com/saas/user-help/approvals/reviewing_access.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\">Approve an Access Request</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><a href=\"https://sailpoint.highspot.com/items/63f3aadb62fa150ef4808194?lfrm=shp.22\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\">Complete a Certification</a></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n<p> </p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">If you would like to schedule a 1:1 help session, please either send an email to <span style=\"color: #236fa1;\">identity-security@example.com</span> or post to the <span style=\"color: #236fa1;\">#help-identity-security</span> slack channel.</span></p>",
                "label": "The links",
